                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                        "entry_id": "a384a072-d5b1-3c77-b7df-be99229fa8b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hiding one's transgender status (in general or in specific areas of one's life, e.g. at work) after transition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ff1d315-668d-40f0-a210-8bcfb6b4bb1d",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "go stealth; be stealth; live stealth"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a382ae40-a4a4-485c-9db8-6c49cfbcecc0",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Lynn is a noted computer scienƟst and distnguished professor emerita of engineering who transitoned from male to female (MTF) in the 1960s and then lived “stealth,” or closeted about her transgender status, before coming out in 2000[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2ec11fa-11ec-4e85-b71b-5457b9f511e5",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "They remained radical in their gender identities and not easily categorized; Darling, for example, lived “stealth” as a woman, and Curtis and Woodlawn alternated between female and male identities in different phases of their lives,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4bc80ed-0161-4c6a-9e5f-ee30c0b26ff9",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Transgender Men and the Persistence of Gender Inequality Kristen Schilt. assigned: “Some of the boys, especially if they are really ... Trey, who was stealth, was accepted at work as one of the only black men in a male-dominated field."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa18918a-3dd2-45ec-8206-3850024b0dd7",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Some respondents felt very comfortable being transgender FtM, […] One participant who was stealth about their gender identity and still presented as female to some friends and family,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f0f8ce3-5171-47c6-aa56-c31b8ce9109a",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Jazz great and band leader Billy Tipton is one well-known example of a transgender person who lived “stealth” (secretly) most of his life. Born Dorothy Lucille tipton, Dorothy became “Billy” as an adolescent and, following a brief[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4afd2ed6-1b11-4fd8-8e77-9429d2e2fa8e",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Because Derek was stealth, they did not know about his trans history. The spring of their sophomore year, the guys decided they all wanted to get an apartment off campus the next year. When Derek brought this up with me,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ad820cb-7919-45e8-96ba-d9f2eb0ed534",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Trans people either lived in the wrong gender, lived 'stealth', or faced ridicule. Times are achanging; every shop assistant who serves us, every taxi driver who gives us a lift, every old person we help, every human we experience,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fe300a5-17ae-4695-9dac-ee56f4859ab2",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "He could claim that he didn't know, that I had withheld my story from him throughout the relationship, the way I've heard some women have, women who lived stealth, who told their husbands that they'd had hysterectomies and lived in fear[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5ef366a-2a91-422c-8f0b-3a9219f63279",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "[…] having a trans partner who was “stealth” and the paradoxical challenges that a trans partner being recognized in accordance with his gender identity[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bf1524a-7031-4991-a35e-a97866b8d7c3",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Since I lived stealth, I wasn't able to continuously have my appointments but only every once in a while. The main reasons were the facial swelling, and the beard hairs had to be a certain length. The health insurance didn't want to pay[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba5f1698-9113-44f4-aece-cfbc6d109122",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "Likewise, another youth (Dan, 20 years old, transmasculine) described encountering issues at his place of employment that were explicit instances of racism or homophobia, and not of transphobia, because he was stealth at work (due to[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eeb0267b-0e1f-4314-a269-805cd732f010",
                                                "sense_id": "ae373fa6-6a7f-38da-8774-49f18e97d4cc",
                                                "text": "CAMERON: For the first year of my transition, I was stealth outside of the Internet, meaning I was not open about being transgender. I always felt people would be weirded out by me, because I saw so many people bash on trans people online. When people read my story,[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
